# kovanica-testnet — never commit operator secrets or runtime state.
#
# 1. PoA authority SIGNING keys. `authority-keys/authorities.conf` is PUBLIC
#    (64-hex pubkeys + threshold) and IS tracked — every node must agree on the
#    set. The `authority-N.env` files next to it are the operator's 32-byte
#    Ed25519 seed (secret, mode 0600) and are referenced by the systemd units as
#    `EnvironmentFile=`. They were tracked until 2026-09-30 and are now untracked;
#    they stay on disk because systemd needs them.
authority-keys/*.env

# 2. Per-seed operator runtime state (snapshots, ledger logs, peer ban state).
seeds/*/data/
seeds/*/keys/
seeds/*/logs/
*.log

# 3. Anything that looks like a local env/secret, repo-wide. `*.env.example`
#    stays trackable.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# 4. Backups / editor / OS noise.
*.backup
*.bak
*.swp
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc
